  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAVE 500 WILD ANIMALS FROM ILLEGAL TRADE</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save Vietnam&apos;s Wildlife rehabilitates between 300 and 500 pangolins and other rescued wild animals from Vietnam&apos;s illegal trade at two rescue centres. After a period of care, around 60% of them are fully recovered and released into protected habitat. Animals that can&apos;t be released due to lack of natural instinct or missing part of the body, are provided a permanent home in large, natural enclosures customised to their needs.</narrative>
  </description>
